{
  "title": "ethtool 查看网卡协商速率（Rocky Linux 9 / ethtool 6.15）",
  "lines": [
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "dnf install -y ethtool"},
    {"t": "cmd", "s": "ethtool eth0"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "Settings for eth0:"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "\tSpeed: 10000Mb/s"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "\tDuplex: Full"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "\tAuto-negotiation: off"},
    {"t": "out", "s": "\tLink detected: yes"},
    {"t": "note", "s": "速率/双工/自协商/链路，四项是排障最先看的字段"}
  ]
}
